## Secrets & local env
.env
.env.local

## Playwright session state (kept in GitHub Actions cache, not git history)
.auth/*.json
!.auth/.gitkeep

## Logs (verbose debug logs are local-only; logs/run_history.jsonl IS committed
## by the workflow as a lightweight audit trail, see run_once.py)
logs/*.log
logs/debug/

## Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/

## Playwright browsers cache (installed per-run, never committed)
.playwright-browsers/

## OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/

## Generated static report build artifacts (rebuilt every run by CI)
docs/_site/
